  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/51YFy9K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"444\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p>此模組新增了超過 200 種光源變化，涵蓋 6 種類型，並為部分光源提供營火、靈魂營火與常規版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6UXDAER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"769\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更新記錄：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 底座現在支援比較器輸出。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v3.0</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cckat5N.png\" width=\"406\" height=\"302\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v2.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 為所有「更多光源」配方的食譜新增解鎖（進度）<br>- 新增設定選項以啟用/停用營火／靈魂營火的合成配方（預設：關閉）<br>&nbsp; （Fabric 版：需要安裝 Mod Menu 與 Cloth Config 才能修改設定，但模組本身無需這些前置即可運作）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">v2.1</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5jSaxxF.png\" width=\"441\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p><strong>v2.0</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5UW5kFL.png\" width=\"434\" height=\"332\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></p>\n<p>火盆與立燈可以透過右鍵點燃。</p>\n<p>它們也需要 2 格的空間。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msZmser.png\" width=\"343\" height=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OhH1pfG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p>您可以使用靈魂法杖將其轉為靈魂營火。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cFAJldB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"388\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 營火不會造成傷害，無火災風險。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 靈魂營火的亮度為 10。</span></li>\n<li>- 潛行放置時不會點燃。在未被破壞前會拒絕接收信號。</li>\n<li>- [1.16] 豬靈會畏懼靈魂營火。（普通火把無效）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>遊戲截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1dXQj4.png\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u3s1aSP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s262Tie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCqX2Sy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBp8Ktp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GgjVXZy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JIlDVu9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"464\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/GBc4Qdr\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/URf80n1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GM8W4wF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p>（以下環境拍攝：材質包：Faithful x32、光影包：BSL v7.1.05p2、地圖：Falcon's Rock v2.0.0）</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>本模組適用於 Faithful x32 的資源包可在此下載。<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-lights/download/3001273</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>您可以自由地將其加入整合包中。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
